{"id":"eaa26a086cb6c5af","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md","title":"Line Bundle","display":"df-line-bundle — Line Bundle","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-line-bundle","aliases":["58-df-line-bundle","Line Bundle"],"display":"df-line-bundle — Line Bundle","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-line-bundle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-line-bundle</span><span>Line Bundle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-line-bundle — Line Bundle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bb62713ade4dcadf\" href=\"?note=bb62713ade4dcadf\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md\">../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2bc9d494c7bff68e\" href=\"?note=2bc9d494c7bff68e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md\">../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k,\\mathscr U,b,b&#39;,F\\in V\">\\(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k,\\mathscr U,b,b&#39;,F\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k,1)\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k,1)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bb62713ade4dcadf\" href=\"?note=bb62713ade4dcadf\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md\">../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinIso}_k:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LinIso}_k:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (homeomorphism and linear-isomorphism predicates inherited by vector bundles)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{LineBundleIso}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{LineBundleIso}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bun}_1(X;k,\\mathscr U),\\operatorname{Pic}(X;k,\\mathscr U)\\in V\">\\(\\operatorname{Bun}_1(X;k,\\mathscr U),\\operatorname{Pic}(X;k,\\mathscr U)\\in V\\)</span> (relative code sets defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong_{\\mathrm{LB}}\\;\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\cong_{\\mathrm{LB}}\\;\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (binary isomorphism relation induced by the ternary witness predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinIso}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{LinIso}_k\\)</span> 沿用向量丛文件中固定的域及纤维运算族；两个丛码使用同一个该族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^{-1}[\\{x\\}]\">\\(p^{-1}[\\{x\\}]\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(p\\prime)^{-1}[\\{x\\}]\">\\((p\\prime)^{-1}[\\{x\\}]\\)</span> 分别采用其已有结构，不随候选同构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 改变。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}line\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k,1)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}line\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k,1)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}line\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}isomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{LineBundleIso}_S(F,b,b&#39;)\\leftrightarrow\\exists p,L,\\tau_L,p&#39;,L&#39;,\\tau_{L&#39;},X,\\tau_X,k\\;\\Bigl(b=\\langle p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k\\rangle\\land b&#39;=\\langle p&#39;,L&#39;,\\tau_{L&#39;},X,\\tau_X,k\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k)\\land\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p&#39;,L&#39;,\\tau_{L&#39;},X,\\tau_X,k)\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(F,L,\\tau_L,L&#39;,\\tau_{L&#39;})\\land p&#39;\\circ F=p\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\mathrm{LinIso}_k(F\\upharpoonright p^{-1}[\\{x\\}],p^{-1}[\\{x\\}],(p&#39;)^{-1}[\\{x\\}])\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}line\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}isomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{LineBundleIso}_S(F,b,b&#39;)\\leftrightarrow\\exists p,L,\\tau_L,p&#39;,L&#39;,\\tau_{L&#39;},X,\\tau_X,k\\;\\Bigl(b=\\langle p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k\\rangle\\land b&#39;=\\langle p&#39;,L&#39;,\\tau_{L&#39;},X,\\tau_X,k\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k)\\land\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p&#39;,L&#39;,\\tau_{L&#39;},X,\\tau_X,k)\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(F,L,\\tau_L,L&#39;,\\tau_{L&#39;})\\land p&#39;\\circ F=p\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\mathrm{LinIso}_k(F\\upharpoonright p^{-1}[\\{x\\}],p^{-1}[\\{x\\}],(p&#39;)^{-1}[\\{x\\}])\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}line\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}isomorphism\\text{-}relation} \\vdash b\\cong_{\\mathrm{LB}}b&#39;\\leftrightarrow\\exists F\\in V\\;\\mathrm{LineBundleIso}_S(F,b,b&#39;)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}line\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}isomorphism\\text{-}relation} \\vdash b\\cong_{\\mathrm{LB}}b&#39;\\leftrightarrow\\exists F\\in V\\;\\mathrm{LineBundleIso}_S(F,b,b&#39;)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}line\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}codes} \\vdash \\operatorname{Bun}_1(X;k,\\mathscr U)\\coloneqq\\{b\\in\\mathscr U:\\exists p,L,\\tau_L,\\tau_X\\;(b=\\langle p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}line\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}codes} \\vdash \\operatorname{Bun}_1(X;k,\\mathscr U)\\coloneqq\\{b\\in\\mathscr U:\\exists p,L,\\tau_L,\\tau_X\\;(b=\\langle p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}line\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}picard} \\vdash \\operatorname{Pic}(X;k,\\mathscr U)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Bun}_1(X;k,\\mathscr U)/\\!\\cong_{\\mathrm{LB}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}line\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}picard} \\vdash \\operatorname{Pic}(X;k,\\mathscr U)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Bun}_1(X;k,\\mathscr U)/\\!\\cong_{\\mathrm{LB}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Line bundle: rank-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> vector bundle; the rank is the final parameter of <code>VectorBundle_S</code>, not the set-theoretic rank from <code>58-df-rank</code>.</li>\n<li>The ambient set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr U\">\\(\\mathscr U\\)</span> prevents the quotient from ranging over a proper class of isomorphic recodings. Tensor product induces the Picard-group operation on the quotient.</li>\n<li>Invertible sheaf: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{O}_X(D)\">\\(\\mathcal{O}_X(D)\\)</span> for divisor <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>; Cartier divisor equivalence</li>\n<li>Very ample: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> very ample <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iff L^{\\otimes n}\">\\(\\iff L^{\\otimes n}\\)</span> gives embedding for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n \\gg 0\">\\(n \\gg 0\\)</span></li>\n<li>Chern-class and tensor-power laws belong in theorem files depending on this definition.</li>\n<li>The quotient is now taken by the binary relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong_{\\mathrm{LB}}\">\\(\\cong_{\\mathrm{LB}}\\)</span>; the former notation incorrectly used the ternary isomorphism-witness predicate itself as an equivalence relation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hartshorne, Algebraic Geometry</li>\n<li>Lazarsfeld, Positivity in Algebraic Geometry</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md","status":"resolved","id":"bb62713ade4dcadf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"2bc9d494c7bff68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md","status":"resolved","id":"bb62713ade4dcadf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k,1)$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k,\\mathscr U,b,b',F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinIso}_k:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{LineBundleIso}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Bun}_1(X;k,\\mathscr U),\\operatorname{Pic}(X;k,\\mathscr U)\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\cong_{\\mathrm{LB}}\\;\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinIso}_k","display":false},{"tex":"p^{-1}[\\{x\\}]","display":false},{"tex":"(p\\prime)^{-1}[\\{x\\}]","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}line\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k,1)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}line\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}isomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{LineBundleIso}_S(F,b,b')\\leftrightarrow\\exists p,L,\\tau_L,p',L',\\tau_{L'},X,\\tau_X,k\\;\\Bigl(b=\\langle p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k\\rangle\\land b'=\\langle p',L',\\tau_{L'},X,\\tau_X,k\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k)\\land\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p',L',\\tau_{L'},X,\\tau_X,k)\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(F,L,\\tau_L,L',\\tau_{L'})\\land p'\\circ F=p\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\mathrm{LinIso}_k(F\\upharpoonright p^{-1}[\\{x\\}],p^{-1}[\\{x\\}],(p')^{-1}[\\{x\\}])\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}line\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}isomorphism\\text{-}relation} \\vdash b\\cong_{\\mathrm{LB}}b'\\leftrightarrow\\exists F\\in V\\;\\mathrm{LineBundleIso}_S(F,b,b')","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}line\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}codes} \\vdash \\operatorname{Bun}_1(X;k,\\mathscr U)\\coloneqq\\{b\\in\\mathscr U:\\exists p,L,\\tau_L,\\tau_X\\;(b=\\langle p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}line\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}picard} \\vdash \\operatorname{Pic}(X;k,\\mathscr U)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Bun}_1(X;k,\\mathscr U)/\\!\\cong_{\\mathrm{LB}}","display":true},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{O}_X(D)","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\iff L^{\\otimes n}","display":false},{"tex":"n \\gg 0","display":false},{"tex":"\\cong_{\\mathrm{LB}}","display":false}],"bytes":3434,"backlinks":[{"id":"6c6d7cb9d5ebdb5c","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S$ and $\\mathrm{LineBundleIso}_S$ (line-bundle predicates, see [[../batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md]])"},{"id":"369c9ce912d7ccb6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k)$（六参数线丛谓词，see [[../batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md]]）"},{"id":"7bd6cfe0ea1aa0a0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S$ (line-bundle predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-783","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md|58-df-line-bundle]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["bb62713ade4dcadf","2bc9d494c7bff68e"]}